13. Find the Nth highest salary

int n = 3;

int nthHighest = employees.stream()
        .map(Employee::getSalary)
        .distinct()
        .sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())
        .skip(n - 1)
        .findFirst()
        .orElseThrow();

Logic

For the 3rd highest:

sorted descending
        ↓
skip(2)
        ↓
findFirst()
        ↓
3rd highest

