14. Partition numbers into even and odd

Map<Boolean, List<Integer>> result = numbers.stream()
        .collect(Collectors.partitioningBy(n -> n % 2 == 0));

Result

true  -> even numbers
false -> odd numbers

Example:

Input:
[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]

Output:
true  -> [2, 4, 6]
false -> [1, 3, 5]

